        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Additionally, with our ability to monitor and manage care within our wide network, we believe we are an attractive business partner to health plans, hospitals, IPAs, and other medical groups seeking to provide better care at lower costs.",
